WEBVTT

08:40.667 --> 08:41.542
Mom, today?

08:43.209 --> 08:44.542
MONDAY

08:44.709 --> 08:46.250
If you strike off every day,

08:46.459 --> 08:48.167
how do I control my anger, Mom?

08:48.542 --> 08:51.042
You've been reading the
same lesson for four days.

08:51.959 --> 08:52.875
What lesson is it?
